WEBVTT

00:07.860 --> 00:11.070
<b>What's the matter, Br...
Elder Brother?</b>

00:11.440 --> 00:13.950
<b>Humans are interesting after all.</b>

00:13.950 --> 00:15.990
<b>What's written there?</b>

00:15.990 --> 00:20.540
<b>It says,
“Existence precedes essence.”</b>

00:20.540 --> 00:21.870
<b>What does that mean?</b>

00:22.120 --> 00:26.170
<b>It means humans
are created by how they live</b>

00:26.170 --> 00:30.500
<b>each and every moment
by their own existence,</b>

00:30.500 --> 00:33.880
<b>and not something determined
beforehand.</b>

00:34.430 --> 00:36.260
<b>I don't get it all.</b>

00:37.760 --> 00:40.930
<b>There will be a time
when you will understand.</b>

00:40.930 --> 00:41.930
<b>Now...</b>

00:41.930 --> 00:43.430
<b>Are we heading to the Playground?</b>

00:43.430 --> 00:46.900
<b>Eve, you should stay home
and read a book today.</b>

00:46.900 --> 00:48.360
<b>I wanna go, too!</b>

00:48.360 --> 00:49.150
<b>You can't.</b>

00:49.440 --> 00:50.440
<b>But...</b>

00:50.440 --> 00:54.110
<b>I'll be right back.
And when I come back, I'll play with you.</b>

00:54.110 --> 00:57.110
<b>Really, Elder Brother?
Then I'll wait for you!</b>

00:57.780 --> 00:59.200
<b>Good boy.</b>

00:59.200 --> 01:04.210
<b>I'll wait right here
until you get back!</b>

01:09.080 --> 01:12.170
<b>Promise, Brother?</b>

02:44.970 --> 02:46.890
<b>Did you know, 2B?</b>

02:46.890 --> 02:47.980
<b>About what?</b>

02:47.980 --> 02:52.560
<b>Deer of that size apparently eat roughly
25 kilograms of grass in a day.</b>

02:53.020 --> 02:54.650
<b>And what about it?</b>

02:54.650 --> 02:58.570
<b>That means they're spending
about half the day eating grass.</b>

02:59.200 --> 03:01.780
<b>Animals have very low fuel efficiency.</b>

03:02.240 --> 03:06.990
<b>According to the records, humans also
ate meals three times a day.</b>

03:06.990 --> 03:09.960
<b>Perhaps you can say that humans
weren't that functional either.</b>

03:10.290 --> 03:12.500
<b>Humans are existences to protect.</b>

03:12.500 --> 03:14.590
<b>Good or bad fuel efficiency
has nothing to do with it.</b>

03:15.840 --> 03:17.510
<b>That sounds like you, 2B.</b>

03:19.090 --> 03:20.340
<b>Oh, that’s right.</b>

03:20.340 --> 03:22.800
<b>About that anomaly that got away...</b>

03:22.800 --> 03:25.430
<b>I haven't gotten any analysis results
from the Bunker whatsoever.</b>

03:26.850 --> 03:29.390
<b>We haven't even received an additional order
to pursue and investigate.</b>

03:29.390 --> 03:31.140
<b>Don't you think that’s a bit strange?</b>

03:31.140 --> 03:32.810
<b>It feels like the Bunker's
correspondence with us...</b>

03:32.810 --> 03:36.570
<b>That’s just saying how much
of an important case it is, right?</b>

03:36.820 --> 03:37.440
<b>But...</b>

03:37.690 --> 03:39.820
<b>They're just being careful about it.</b>

03:40.030 --> 03:41.820
<b>Is that really so?</b>

03:41.820 --> 03:45.530
<b>I get a feeling that
they're intentionally not telling us.</b>

03:46.950 --> 03:49.830
<b><i>Operator 6O to 2B.</i></b>

03:49.830 --> 03:51.710
<b><i>It's time for your
regularly scheduled report.</i></b>

03:51.710 --> 03:53.330
<b>This is 2B. Nothing to repor—</b>

03:53.330 --> 03:58.340
<b><i>2B, please listen. I was looking at image data
for flowers today.</i></b>

03:58.340 --> 03:59.170
<b>Flowers?</b>

03:59.170 --> 04:03.130
<b><i>Yes. In the very few documents
recorded in the Bunker,</i></b>

04:03.130 --> 04:05.890
<b><i>there was a flower called a Lunar Tear.</i></b>

04:06.050 --> 04:08.100
<b><i>I bet you'd look really nice</i></b>

04:08.100 --> 04:11.730
<b><i>if you put one of those in your hair, 2B.
It'd suit your stylish looks!</i></b>

04:11.890 --> 04:13.060
<b>There is no need.</b>

04:13.060 --> 04:17.730
<b><i>Oh, don't say that. What kind of girl
doesn't want to look good?</i></b>

04:17.730 --> 04:22.070
<b><i>I'll let you know
if I find anything else that’s cute, okay?</i></b>

04:22.070 --> 04:24.740
<b>Um, there’s something
I would like to ask.</b>

04:24.740 --> 04:25.570
<b><i>Yes?</i></b>

04:25.570 --> 04:27.910
<b>About the confirmation status
of that anomaly...</b>

04:27.910 --> 04:33.250
<b><i>I'm sorry, that's out of my jurisdiction,
so I don't know.</i></b>

04:33.540 --> 04:38.170
<b><i>But anyway, I would very much like
to see a real Lunar Tear.</i></b>

04:38.170 --> 04:41.710
<b><i>If you manage to find one,
please let me know.</i></b>

04:41.840 --> 04:44.050
<b><i>Operator 6O, out.</i></b>

04:44.380 --> 04:45.380
<b>Um...</b>

04:47.850 --> 04:50.680
<b>Didn't that seem a little strange,
like I told you?</b>

04:50.680 --> 04:54.230
<b>Indeed. There is no need
for hairpins in my mission.</b>

04:54.230 --> 04:55.020
<b>No!</b>

04:55.020 --> 04:56.520
<b>Not about that.</b>

04:56.520 --> 05:00.070
<b>It felt like she was somewhat dodging
my question right?</b>

05:00.320 --> 05:02.570
<b>Missions don't need hairpins...</b>

05:03.070 --> 05:05.360
<b>or excessive scrutiny.</b>

05:07.240 --> 05:09.950
<b>Wouldn't it be okay
to at least have a hairpin?</b>

05:09.950 --> 05:11.910
<b>I would like to see that as well.</b>

05:12.120 --> 05:16.080
<b>And you can start calling me
"Nines" at any point, okay?</b>

05:16.080 --> 05:17.750
<b>Not yet.</b>

05:17.750 --> 05:19.880
<b>Not yet?</b>

05:21.590 --> 05:24.380
<b><i>Please hold on!
That is a dangerous place!</i></b>

05:24.380 --> 05:25.720
<b>That machine lifeform...</b>

05:25.720 --> 05:27.380
<b><i>Oh, please come back!</i></b>

05:27.380 --> 05:29.680
<b>Something’s wrong.
Let's go after them.</b>

05:29.680 --> 05:31.850
<b>Huh? It might be a trap!</b>

05:33.640 --> 05:34.640
<b>Sheesh.</b>

05:37.270 --> 05:42.020
<b><i>My oh my, what a great place
to see the two of you.</i></b>

05:42.020 --> 05:44.900
<b><i>Truly help from the heavens!</i></b>

05:46.860 --> 05:48.360
<b>What’s going on?</b>

05:48.610 --> 05:53.330
<b><i>The thing is, it seems her little sister
has gotten lost.</i></b>

05:53.740 --> 05:54.870
<b>Her little sister?</b>

05:55.450 --> 05:56.910
<b><i>It's all my fault.</i></b>

05:56.910 --> 06:03.250
<b><i>I think she overheard me complaining about
how one of my parts was starting to seize up.</i></b>

06:03.630 --> 06:08.180
<b><i>So she went off to the Forest Kingdom
in search of replacement parts.</i></b>

06:08.260 --> 06:14.520
<b><i>The "kingdom" is a very dangerous place
with many violent and insular machine lifeforms.</i></b>

06:14.930 --> 06:16.770
<b>Why go to such a place?</b>

06:16.770 --> 06:18.690
<b><i>The parts are very old,</i></b>

06:18.690 --> 06:21.650
<b><i>so they can only be obtained
in the ruins within the Forest Kingdom.</i></b>

06:21.650 --> 06:26.780
<b><i>Please, please find my little sister!</i></b>

06:26.780 --> 06:30.110
<b><i>She is the only family I have.</i></b>

06:30.110 --> 06:31.870
<b><i>There, there.</i></b>

06:30.700 --> 06:36.250
<b><i>Please, please, please.</i></b>

06:31.870 --> 06:34.700
<b>So I've been wondering for a while...</b>

06:34.700 --> 06:38.160
<b>What does it mean
to be machine lifeform siblings?</b>

06:38.160 --> 06:41.000
<b>Maybe they were built
in the same factory?</b>

06:41.000 --> 06:42.080
<b>Maybe.</b>

06:42.080 --> 06:43.500
<b><i>Both of you...</i></b>

06:43.790 --> 06:48.220
<b><i>You wouldn't be able to help, would you?</i></b>

06:48.300 --> 06:51.590
<b>I decline.
We don't have such duties or obligations—</b>

06:51.590 --> 06:54.100
<b><i>It's my fault!</i></b>

06:54.100 --> 06:56.640
<b><i>Yes. Right. You must be worried.</i></b>

06:57.270 --> 06:58.890
<b><i>So, please?</i></b>

06:59.350 --> 07:00.190
<b>We don't have such—</b>

07:00.190 --> 07:02.690
<b><i>I have to do something about this!</i></b>

07:02.690 --> 07:05.480
<b><i>Something will be done, it will!</i></b>

07:05.980 --> 07:09.070
<b><i>I must hurry over and save her!</i></b>

07:09.070 --> 07:12.490
<b><i>They will hurry over. They will... Right?</i></b>

07:12.820 --> 07:14.280
<b><i>Right? Right?</i></b>

07:14.780 --> 07:15.660
<b><i>Right?</i></b>

07:17.290 --> 07:18.700
<b>Where can we start looking?</b>

07:19.870 --> 07:21.290
<b><i>Thank you very much.</i></b>

07:21.290 --> 07:22.250
<b>No way.</b>

07:22.580 --> 07:27.840
<b><i>They will make sure to find
your little sister. I promise you!</i></b>

07:27.840 --> 07:29.510
<b><i>I'm so happy!</i></b>

07:30.510 --> 07:32.720
<b><i>Right, both of you?</i></b>

07:40.390 --> 07:42.650
<b>Pascal, that body...</b>

07:42.650 --> 07:44.060
<b><i>Oh, this?</i></b>

07:44.690 --> 07:48.360
<b><i>Isn't it great? I tuned it up myself.</i></b>

07:48.360 --> 07:50.900
<b>So you can interchange body parts.</b>

07:51.280 --> 07:53.780
<b><i>Yes. I am a machine lifeform after all.</i></b>

07:53.780 --> 07:56.990
<b><i>Most parts are interchangeable.
For instance...</i></b>

07:57.620 --> 07:59.500
<b><i>I can make my chest into a chainsaw.</i></b>

08:00.250 --> 08:02.000
<b><i>I can make my torso into a boat.</i></b>

08:02.500 --> 08:04.630
<b><i>I can play with the children.</i></b>

08:04.830 --> 08:07.040
<b><i>So it is rather useful.</i></b>

08:07.040 --> 08:09.920
<b>Useful, or you lack principles.</b>

08:10.010 --> 08:12.220
<b><i>How is it for you androids?</i></b>

08:13.800 --> 08:16.470
<b>We are different
from you machine lifeforms</b>

08:16.470 --> 08:20.310
<b>in that we can't mess with our bodies much,
nor do we want to.</b>

08:20.390 --> 08:24.350
<b><i>It's more useful when you can
interchange parts. Right, 2B?</i></b>

08:25.770 --> 08:29.230
<b>How much parts do you swap out
before you lose yourself?</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:32.820
<b><i>I never gave any thought to that.</i></b>

08:33.030 --> 08:36.570
<b><i>I wonder how much it would be?
Truly fascinating.</i></b>

08:36.570 --> 08:39.580
<b>It wouldn't matter how much
for machine lifeforms.</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:42.620
<b>Because you can easily change anything.</b>

08:42.620 --> 08:44.960
<b><i>You're quite caustic.</i></b>

08:46.250 --> 08:50.590
<b><i>If you take the wings from a bird,
will it no longer be a bird?</i></b>

08:50.590 --> 08:54.590
<b><i>If you took antlers from a deer,
will it no longer be a deer?</i></b>

08:54.590 --> 08:57.600
<b>What needs to remain
for you to still be yourself?</b>

08:59.140 --> 09:01.810
<b><i>I believe there is some value
in thinking about that.</i></b>

09:01.810 --> 09:04.810
<b>What kind of value
do machine lifeforms have?</b>

09:04.810 --> 09:06.060
<b>9S.</b>

09:06.060 --> 09:06.980
<b>Because they...</b>

09:06.980 --> 09:08.270
<b>9S.</b>

09:08.270 --> 09:09.320
<b><i>Both of you...</i></b>

09:09.900 --> 09:14.070
<b><i>We'll arrive at our target location soon.
We may be noticed by hostile units.</i></b>

09:14.070 --> 09:16.160
<b><i>Let's land before proceeding further.</i></b>

09:16.570 --> 09:18.200
<b>You're the only one flying.</b>

09:18.200 --> 09:19.530
<b>9S.</b>

09:19.530 --> 09:20.740
<b>Okay.</b>

09:28.040 --> 09:31.550
<b>FOREST KINGDOM</b>

09:33.710 --> 09:36.300
<b><i>Perhaps it is your heart?</i></b>

09:36.300 --> 09:37.470
<b>Huh?</b>

09:37.470 --> 09:39.890
<b><i>Our discussion from earlier.</i></b>

09:39.890 --> 09:42.770
<b><i>What needs to remain
for you to still be yourself.</i></b>

09:42.770 --> 09:45.060
<b><i>The answer is perhaps your heart?</i></b>

09:46.730 --> 09:51.770
<b><i>The big sister worried about her little sister.
Isn't that all because she has a heart?</i></b>

09:51.770 --> 09:54.780
<b>A heart on a machine lifeform?</b>

09:55.400 --> 09:56.700
<b><i>Is that strange?</i></b>

09:56.700 --> 09:59.780
<b>Strange or not, that's something
completely impossible.</b>

10:00.280 --> 10:04.040
<b><i>Then, are androids also lacking "hearts"?</i></b>

10:04.580 --> 10:05.870
<b>This thing...</b>

10:06.080 --> 10:08.040
<b><i>How strange.</i></b>

10:08.040 --> 10:10.580
<b><i>I don't see the lookout soldiers.</i></b>

10:10.580 --> 10:11.960
<b>What do you mean?</b>

10:11.960 --> 10:14.130
<b><i>The forest is their territory,</i></b>

10:14.130 --> 10:18.470
<b><i>so usually they show themselves
when we simply set foot in here.</i></b>

10:18.470 --> 10:20.550
<b><i>Something like this has never...</i></b>

10:20.550 --> 10:21.680
<b><i>Oh! Over there!</i></b>

10:22.180 --> 10:23.930
<b><i>It's the little sister's ribbon!</i></b>

10:24.270 --> 10:26.060
<b><i>There's no doubt about it.</i></b>

10:26.230 --> 10:28.560
<b><i>We must find the little sister quickly.</i></b>

10:28.890 --> 10:33.230
<b><i>Report. Confirmed hostile
machine lifeform signal up ahead.</i></b>

10:34.730 --> 10:36.690
<b><i>H-Hold on.</i></b>

10:36.820 --> 10:40.910
<b><i>I will go see what's going on first,
as a fellow machine lifeform!</i></b>

10:41.240 --> 10:42.950
<b>I just can't fully trust you.</b>

10:43.240 --> 10:46.660
<b><i>I will convince them,
so please wait here.</i></b>

10:46.660 --> 10:50.790
<b><i>My name is Pascal!
I am the leader of a peaceful village!</i></b>

10:50.790 --> 10:53.790
<b><i>Please listen to what I have to say first!</i></b>

10:54.170 --> 10:56.510
<b>Maybe there's some sort of catch?</b>

10:56.510 --> 10:58.380
<b>I don't think so.</b>

11:01.590 --> 11:04.100
<b><i>It was teetering as it stood,
so I approached it,</i></b>

11:04.100 --> 11:06.350
<b><i>and it suddenly split in two.</i></b>

11:06.350 --> 11:08.560
<b>Looks like quite the master who did this.</b>

11:08.730 --> 11:11.350
<b>Yeah. It was downed in one blow.</b>

11:11.600 --> 11:13.020
<b>Who in the world...</b>

11:13.270 --> 11:16.780
<b><i>That master might be up ahead.</i></b>

11:17.570 --> 11:19.570
<b><i>There is a need for us to understand</i></b>

11:19.570 --> 11:22.490
<b><i>the current situation, so we can search
for the little sister, too.</i></b>

11:23.370 --> 11:26.490
<b><i>Up ahead is the center of the kingdom.</i></b>

11:26.830 --> 11:29.040
<b><i>It’s the castle where the king lives.</i></b>

11:37.300 --> 11:40.720
<b>Indeed, this does seem
like a castle where a king lives.</b>

11:41.510 --> 11:42.930
<b>Don't let your guard down.</b>

11:42.930 --> 11:43.760
<b>Okay.</b>

11:48.720 --> 11:52.060
<b><i>The Forest Kingdom army
is known for their strength, and yet...</i></b>

11:57.190 --> 12:00.240
<b><i>You came again, android!</i></b>

12:00.240 --> 12:01.360
<b>Android?</b>

12:03.320 --> 12:06.620
<b><i>D-Die!</i></b>

12:08.080 --> 12:09.580
<b><i>What in the...</i></b>

12:09.580 --> 12:12.500
<b>Pod, are there any combat records
for a separate squad?</b>

12:12.580 --> 12:14.880
<b><i>Analysis. No orders have been given</i></b>

12:14.880 --> 12:18.840
<b><i>for YoRHa Soldiers
to be deployed into current area.</i></b>

12:19.260 --> 12:20.670
<b>Then who...</b>

12:30.220 --> 12:31.350
<b>What's that?</b>

12:33.730 --> 12:35.810
<b><i>I have heard in the past.</i></b>

12:35.900 --> 12:38.730
<b><i>I believe this is the previous king.</i></b>

12:38.730 --> 12:39.650
<b>King?</b>

12:40.530 --> 12:43.280
<b>It seems like this unit
broke down quite a while ago.</b>

12:48.990 --> 12:51.790
<b>This is media for recording.</b>

12:52.410 --> 12:54.330
<b>Pod, share data.</b>

12:54.330 --> 12:58.340
<b><i>Affirmative.
Media recording data saved.</i></b>

12:58.340 --> 12:59.920
<b><i>Commencing sharing.</i></b>

13:02.380 --> 13:09.470
<b>256 YEARS AGO</b>

13:05.340 --> 13:09.010
<b><i>I think. Therefore, I have resolved.</i></b>

13:09.760 --> 13:17.230
<b><i>This land will be our kingdom,
and I declare our sublime independence!</i></b>

13:17.770 --> 13:19.520
<b><i>Kingdom?</i></b>

13:19.520 --> 13:20.690
<b><i>What's that?</i></b>

13:21.110 --> 13:25.530
<b><i>A kingdom is something like
a large house.</i></b>

13:25.530 --> 13:29.700
<b><i>And citizens
are something like a family.</i></b>

13:30.120 --> 13:33.410
<b><i>Good. Good. That sounds good.</i></b>

13:37.630 --> 13:44.300
<b><i>The machine lifeform community of this nation
had been established far before ours.</i></b>

13:44.300 --> 13:45.670
<b><i>I admire them.</i></b>

13:45.670 --> 13:49.800
<b>Why did they hold onto such a record
like it was something so important?</b>

13:49.800 --> 13:52.220
<b><i>Perhaps to reminisce.</i></b>

13:52.600 --> 13:53.930
<b>Reminisce?</b>

13:53.930 --> 13:58.440
<b><i>They want to know how they came to be.</i></b>

13:58.440 --> 14:01.690
<b><i>Besides, it's not a record. It's history.</i></b>

14:02.070 --> 14:03.530
<b>How are they different?</b>

14:03.690 --> 14:07.700
<b><i>History is something
filled with their emotions.</i></b>

14:07.700 --> 14:09.870
<b><i>See, over here too.</i></b>

14:11.410 --> 14:19.040
<b>128 YEARS AGO</b>

14:13.660 --> 14:16.250
<b><i>The king has died.</i></b>

14:16.250 --> 14:19.040
<b><i>Our king who gave us energy.</i></b>

14:19.710 --> 14:21.340
<b><i>So sad.</i></b>

14:21.340 --> 14:23.800
<b><i>Yeah. So sad.</i></b>

14:24.260 --> 14:28.970
<b><i>I put memory in this child
as a memento of our king.</i></b>

14:29.090 --> 14:32.430
<b><i>We'll raise this one to be our next king.</i></b>

14:36.180 --> 14:38.350
<b><i>We are family.</i></b>

14:38.730 --> 14:41.860
<b><i>The kingdom is our home.</i></b>

14:43.190 --> 14:48.360
<b>4 HOURS AGO</b>

14:44.780 --> 14:48.360
<b><i>Today is a festival
to celebrate the day our king died!</i></b>

14:48.860 --> 14:52.950
<b><i>A festival to celebrate
the birth of a new king!</i></b>

14:53.450 --> 14:55.040
<b><i>B-Big news!</i></b>

14:55.040 --> 14:58.250
<b><i>An intruder has entered the kingdom!</i></b>

15:04.840 --> 15:06.170
<b>Intruder?</b>

15:07.800 --> 15:11.260
<b><i>The citizens are very exclusive, so...</i></b>

15:13.300 --> 15:17.020
<b>Pascal, stay here.
We will go look for it.</b>

15:17.020 --> 15:19.940
<b><i>It's all right. I will go with you!</i></b>

15:19.940 --> 15:20.850
<b>But...</b>

15:20.850 --> 15:23.560
<b>2B, let's leave it alone already.</b>

15:23.560 --> 15:24.980
<b>What are you saying
after we've come this far?</b>

15:24.980 --> 15:27.690
<b>There are too many things happening
that are beyond our expectations.</b>

15:27.690 --> 15:30.030
<b>There's a possibility
that it's a trap this thing set up.</b>

15:30.030 --> 15:31.450
<b><i>I have done no such thing.</i></b>

15:31.450 --> 15:35.830
<b>What if this thing is connected
with whatever this intruder is?</b>

15:35.830 --> 15:41.080
<b>We don't have proof of that anywhere.
In any case, we need to find the little sister.</b>

15:41.620 --> 15:43.500
<b><i>Thank you very much.</i></b>

15:45.340 --> 15:47.460
<b>You're such a softie, 2B.</b>

15:57.100 --> 15:58.810
<b>Pascal...</b>

15:59.680 --> 16:02.900
<b><i>You called me Pascal for the first time.</i></b>

16:03.560 --> 16:04.860
<b>Why?</b>

16:12.320 --> 16:15.990
<b>Pod, look up the machine lifeform signal
that they're searching for.</b>

16:15.990 --> 16:16.990
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

16:16.990 --> 16:18.120
<b><i>9S.</i></b>

16:18.660 --> 16:21.250
<b><i>Thank you so much!</i></b>

16:21.370 --> 16:23.670
<b>How can I show my gratitude?</b>

16:23.670 --> 16:25.250
<b>You don't need to do anything like that.</b>

16:25.250 --> 16:26.630
<b><i>But I must insist.</i></b>

16:28.840 --> 16:31.720
<b>I still don't trust you yet.</b>

16:31.720 --> 16:35.970
<b>I might be able to know more about
the mystery android sooner if I helped you.</b>

16:35.970 --> 16:37.100
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:40.680
<b><i>Report. Confirmed
machine lifeform signal.</i></b>

16:42.020 --> 16:42.940
<b>Right here?</b>

16:43.520 --> 16:46.480
<b><i>Little Sister,
if you're here, come ou—</i></b>

16:50.030 --> 16:52.570
<b><i>Uncle Pascal?</i></b>

16:52.570 --> 16:56.160
<b><i>Oh, I'm glad.
You were all right, Little Sister.</i></b>

16:56.160 --> 17:01.580
<b><i>I was scared! I was so scared!</i></b>

17:01.580 --> 17:04.500
<b><i>There, there, it's all right now.</i></b>

17:04.500 --> 17:07.840
<b><i>I was searching for Big Sister's parts, and...</i></b>

17:07.840 --> 17:12.170
<b><i>I know. I know.
You are a really good girl.</i></b>

17:14.930 --> 17:17.800
<b><i>These folks here were able to find you.</i></b>

17:17.800 --> 17:21.140
<b><i>Big Brother, Big Sister, thank you!</i></b>

17:21.140 --> 17:24.770
<b>Well, it's nothing worth thanking me about.</b>

17:24.770 --> 17:25.810
<b>Right, 2B?</b>

17:28.520 --> 17:30.110
<b><i>You guys are...</i></b>

17:31.150 --> 17:35.570
<b><i>It's all right.
They came here to look for me.</i></b>

17:35.570 --> 17:37.570
<b><i>But these guys are...</i></b>

17:37.570 --> 17:41.240
<b><i>This is the one who saved me.</i></b>

17:41.620 --> 17:44.540
<b><i>I see. Thank you for taking care of her.</i></b>

17:44.540 --> 17:48.670
<b><i>These androids came with me
for the rescue.</i></b>

17:48.670 --> 17:50.340
<b><i>There's nothing to worry about.</i></b>

17:50.670 --> 17:51.960
<b><i>We'll see.</i></b>

17:51.960 --> 17:55.590
<b><i>By the way, I’m going to become
a family with this one!</i></b>

17:57.470 --> 18:04.310
<b><i>I want to be family! I love him
just as much as I love my Big Sister.</i></b>

18:05.560 --> 18:09.440
<b><i>Oh, so you're getting married.
This is a joyous occasion!</i></b>

18:09.440 --> 18:12.480
<b><i>Right! Married! I'm getting married!</i></b>

18:12.780 --> 18:15.240
<b>Machine lifeforms getting married?</b>

18:15.530 --> 18:19.030
<b><i>Um, what exactly happened here?</i></b>

18:19.030 --> 18:22.580
<b><i>Everyone was defeated by the intruder.</i></b>

18:23.790 --> 18:30.130
<b><i>So I beg you. Our king...
Please save our little king.</i></b>

18:30.130 --> 18:31.460
<b>Little king?</b>

18:32.040 --> 18:34.840
<b><i>Please. Please.</i></b>

18:36.510 --> 18:40.300
<b>We found the little sister now,
so why don't we head back?</b>

18:40.300 --> 18:45.060
<b><i>Big Brother, Big Sister,
please save the king.</i></b>

18:45.060 --> 18:47.940
<b>Hey, we're not some handymen, okay?</b>

18:47.940 --> 18:48.940
<b>Where is he?</b>

18:48.940 --> 18:50.270
<b>2B.</b>

18:50.810 --> 18:52.730
<b>Up above, in the throne room.</b>

18:53.400 --> 18:54.820
<b>Wait here.</b>

18:55.900 --> 18:59.110
<b>Hold on a second, 2B!</b>

19:01.320 --> 19:03.700
<b>There are limits on how much
of a softie you can be!</b>

19:03.700 --> 19:05.870
<b>In the first place, machine lifeforms...</b>

19:07.000 --> 19:08.330
<b>This voice...</b>

19:12.630 --> 19:13.750
<b>Over there.</b>

19:20.760 --> 19:21.930
<b>So this is...</b>

19:22.260 --> 19:23.930
<b>...the little king.</b>

19:45.740 --> 19:48.620
<b>2B, that's an android!</b>

19:49.710 --> 19:52.710
<b><i>So that's the intruder
who destroyed the kingdom...</i></b>

19:55.710 --> 19:56.750
<b>What are you doing?</b>

19:57.050 --> 20:00.380
<b>YoRHa units are protecting
a machine lifeform?</b>

20:03.140 --> 20:08.060
<b><i>Confirming that this is a unit
wanted by YoRHa, the fugitive unit A2.</i></b>

20:08.060 --> 20:09.350
<b><i>Annihilation recommended.</i></b>

20:09.810 --> 20:14.310
<b>She's an enemy?
But she's a YoRHa unit just like us.</b>

20:14.310 --> 20:17.690
<b><i>A2 is a deserter. She has betrayed
the Council of Humanity,</i></b>

20:17.690 --> 20:20.110
<b><i>and destroyed multiple pursuit androids.</i></b>

20:20.440 --> 20:22.110
<b>Destroyed? But why?</b>

20:22.110 --> 20:23.860
<b>9S. Let's go.</b>

20:23.860 --> 20:24.910
<b>2B!</b>

20:36.630 --> 20:39.420
<b>Why? Why did you betray us?</b>

20:42.930 --> 20:45.890
<b>Command is the one that betrayed.</b>

22:40.750 --> 22:43.170
<b>POD 042 REPORTING TO ALL OF MANKIND.</b>

22:40.750 --> 22:43.170
<b>WE WILL NOW EXECUTE THE TASK
OF INTRODUCING THE MULTIPLE ENDINGS
FOR THE VIDEO GAME "NIER:AUTOMATA." OVER.</b>

22:44.760 --> 22:47.340
<b>PUPPET PLAY
NIER:AUTOMATA
“PASCAL CLASS”</b>

22:49.550 --> 22:51.300
<b><i>Hello, everyone.</i></b>

22:51.300 --> 22:54.010
<b>- Hello!
<i>- Hello!</i></b>

22:54.140 --> 22:58.310
<b><i>Today, let's study up about
the Kingdom of Day and Kingdom of Night.</i></b>

22:58.310 --> 22:59.810
<b>- Okay!
<i>- Okay!</i></b>

22:59.810 --> 23:03.480
<b><i>The place where we are in now
is called the Kingdom of Day.</i></b>

23:03.480 --> 23:06.110
<b><i>It never turns to night here.</i></b>

23:06.110 --> 23:08.280
<b><i>Do you all know what night is?</i></b>

23:08.280 --> 23:09.780
<b><i>I don't know!</i></b>

23:09.780 --> 23:11.570
<b>I know!</b>

23:11.570 --> 23:16.450
<b><i>Night is the condition where light
from a star called the Sun doesn't reach.</i></b>

23:16.450 --> 23:20.540
<b><i>When that happens, the light from the skies
like we have now would be all gone.</i></b>

23:20.540 --> 23:22.290
<b>- Scary!
<i>- Scary!</i></b>

23:22.290 --> 23:25.550
<b><i>And in the Kingdom of Night,
where the light of day does not reach,</i></b>

23:25.550 --> 23:27.970
<b><i>a giant creature called a dragon
flies through the skies—</i></b>

23:27.970 --> 23:28.880
<b>Hey.</b>

23:30.840 --> 23:33.220
<b>- So scary!
<i>- So scary!</i></b>

23:34.470 --> 23:37.220
<b>A2 destroyed Pascal.
Pascal's death lead to the collapse of his village
and its residents went out of control,
resulting in the elimination
of all androids on Earth.</b>

23:37.980 --> 23:39.980
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
